# Build artifacts
*.o
*.so
# Generated header-dependency files (make -MMD -MP). Most land beside their object
# in build/ (already ignored); the rules that compile-and-link in one step
# (AngelServ / AngelMaster / ozpack) emit them next to the EXE, i.e. the repo root.
*.d
# The client binary is built at the repo ROOT. Anchor it: a bare `Angels95`
# also ignores GameData/Game/Angels95/ and silently kept the ENTIRE game
# hierarchy (game/campaign/sector/mission/objective defs) out of every commit
# and tag. A fresh checkout then failed test_game/test_game_state with
# gm.Loaded() == false and released b95/b96 never produced assets. Same trap
# as AngelEd/AngelEd below - never use a bare name for a directory-shaped word.
/Angels95
/AngelServ
/AngelMaster
/OzPack
# The editor binary lives INSIDE AngelEd/ (Makefile target `AngelEd`), so this has
# to be the path, not the bare name. A bare `AngelEd` excludes the whole source
# directory, and git will not descend into an excluded directory - so every NEW file
# under AngelEd/Source/ was silently ignored while the 59 already-tracked ones kept
# working. That is the "added in one place, CI breaks silently" trap from AGENTS.md.
# `*.exe` below already covers AngelEd/AngelEd.exe; this covers the extensionless
# Linux build. See the GameData/Screenshots note for the same lesson.
AngelEd/AngelEd
oz_server

# CI release staging (populated on runners only)
release/

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
OmegaTech

# Build output directories
System/
@System/

# Windows executables
*.exe

# Save files (binary, do not commit)
*.sav
GameData/Saves/

build.log

# Runtime logs written by the editor and the client. AngelEd.log is how the editor
# reports what it did (EditorLog in Core/EditorLog.cpp) and is the first thing to look
# at when picking or deleting misbehaves - it is a diagnostic, not an artifact to keep.
# It was previously untracked-but-not-ignored, so every editor run left a file that
# could be swept into an unrelated commit.
*.log
!build.log
AngelEd/*.log

# Build cache
build/*.DB
build/*.DB-shm
build/*.DB-wal
build/*.db

# Precompiled headers
*.gch
# Build cache
build/*.DB
build/*.DB-shm
build/*.DB-wal

build/VSCODE-BROWSE.DB*
build/cmake*

# Docs scratch
.docs/

# Debug screenshot renders (--shot mode output; regenerate, never commit).
# Exception: the curated showcase set below is committed so the README/Wiki
# image links resolve on GitHub. Everything else in here stays ignored, which
# is why the rule matches contents (/*) instead of the directory - git cannot
# re-include files from inside an excluded directory.
GameData/Screenshots/*
!GameData/Screenshots/CitadelRuins_*.png
!GameData/Screenshots/Dessert_Dreams_*.png
!GameData/Screenshots/Dust_Ravine_*.png
!GameData/Screenshots/EngineTest_*.png
# b111 campaign gallery (README/Wiki "Campaign" section)
!GameData/Screenshots/Sektor_02_MegacityGrid_*.png
!GameData/Screenshots/Sektor_03_AegisBaseAlpha_*.png
!GameData/Screenshots/AlShaddai_Metropolis_*.png
!GameData/Screenshots/Chasm_ForgottenMemories_*.png
!GameData/Screenshots/Refinery_Complex_02B_*.png
!GameData/Screenshots/Digital_Purgatory_*.png
!GameData/Screenshots/Phantom_Hubs_*.png
!GameData/Screenshots/SoulEater_Vaults_*.png
!GameData/Screenshots/Citadel_AstralMind_*.png
!GameData/Screenshots/Esoteric_Altar_Chambers_*.png
!GameData/Screenshots/NearDeath_Threshold_*.png

